abstract: "This repository defines and documents The Nothing Test, an AI Foundations evaluation designed to observe what a language model produces when the user supplies no new semantic direction after establishing an initial self-referential test frame. It preserves the test instruction, completed test records, paired analytical summaries, methodological boundaries, and observable results required for comparison across models and runs, while preserving Alyssa Solen as author and source."

